sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend (chat / connectors / orchestrator_cli)
    participant ST as CredentialStore (RAM)
    participant MGR as sandbox (services/sandbox.py)
    participant SQ as squid proxy (conv)
    participant RN as toolbox (conv)
    participant EXT as External targets (K8s / gitlab.com / AWS)

    Note over U,EXT: 1) SESSION OPEN
    U->>FE: opens a session
    FE->>BE: WS connect
    BE->>MGR: sandbox.ensure(sid)  (lazy provisioning on 1st message)
    MGR->>SQ: creates internal network + squid proxy (STATIC allowlist)
    MGR->>RN: creates toolbox (HTTP(S)_PROXY=squid, vol .claude/workdir, creds .aws/.kube RAM)
    BE-->>FE: ready

    Note over U,EXT: 2) MESSAGE #1 (no connector granted)
    U->>FE: "describe the cluster state"
    FE->>BE: WS message
    BE->>ST: build_connector_env(sid) -> {} (nothing granted)
    BE->>MGR: docker exec runner claude -p ... stream-json
    MGR->>RN: launches claude
    RN->>SQ: kubectl ... (via proxy)
    SQ->>EXT: K8s API (allowlisted) OK
    EXT-->>RN: response
    RN-->>BE: stdout -> ChatEvent
    BE-->>FE: response (streaming)

    Note over U,EXT: 3) GIVE ACCESS TO GITLAB
    U->>FE: click "Give access to GitLab"
    FE->>BE: initiate (PKCE) -> redirect
    U->>EXT: consent gitlab.com (read_api, read_repository)
    EXT-->>BE: callback (code)
    BE->>EXT: exchange_code
    EXT-->>BE: access_token (~2 h)
    BE->>ST: put(sid, gitlab) - token in RAM
    Note over BE,SQ: no squid reload - gitlab.com already in the static allowlist
    BE-->>FE: GitLab = connected

    Note over U,EXT: 4) GIVE ACCESS TO AWS
    U->>FE: click "Give access to AWS"
    FE->>BE: initiate (PKCE) -> redirect Identity Center
    U->>EXT: consent SSO
    EXT-->>BE: callback (code)
    BE->>EXT: exchange_code -> SSO token + ListAccounts/ListAccountRoles
    EXT-->>BE: allowed accounts / roles
    BE-->>FE: needs_selection (account+role list)
    U->>FE: picks account + role
    FE->>BE: aws/select
    BE->>EXT: GetRoleCredentials -> STS (~1 h)
    EXT-->>BE: STS creds
    BE->>ST: put(sid, aws) - STS in RAM (projected into the toolbox's RAM .aws)
    Note over BE,SQ: no squid reload - AWS control plane already in the static allowlist
    BE-->>FE: AWS = connected (account/role + expiry)

    Note over U,EXT: 5) MESSAGE #2 (GitLab + AWS granted)
    U->>FE: "correlate the GitLab code and the cluster's AWS infra"
    FE->>BE: WS message
    BE->>ST: build_connector_env(sid) -> {GITLAB_TOKEN, AWS_*}
    BE->>MGR: docker exec -e GITLAB_TOKEN -e AWS_* runner claude -p ...
    MGR->>RN: launches claude (creds in the env)
    RN->>SQ: kubectl / aws / curl gitlab (via proxy)
    SQ->>EXT: K8s OK, *.amazonaws.com OK, gitlab.com OK
    EXT-->>RN: results
    RN-->>BE: stdout -> ChatEvent
    BE-->>FE: response (streaming)

    Note over U,EXT: 6) CLOSE / IDLE
    BE->>MGR: teardown(sid)
    MGR->>RN: stop + rm
    MGR->>SQ: stop + rm + network deletion
    BE->>ST: revoke_session(sid) - creds purged
